ta-ts=\"1764658921187\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/03/07/50494840/8ec6127a6d4363462a001191b6d4cc35_6571725399108228044.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">430</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">27</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「有人在处，便有纷争。纷争在处，便是江湖。」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">若去请教一位真正行走「江湖」的少女，她付之一笑。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">她只是说，恩怨情仇，转瞬即逝，输赢成败，略显老套。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">如今，少女擢剑而行，走得越远，看得越淡。毕竟——</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">凡事皆可一餐了之，如未解，便再来一餐！</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"valkyrie\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-valkyrie obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器展示</h2> <ul data-target=\"skill.items\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn-list\"><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn obc-tmpl__switch-btn--active\">\n      初始外观\n    </li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn\">\n      满星外观\n    </li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__swit