A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F3908%2Fdetail%3Fbbs_presentation_style%3Dno_header%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22obc-content%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E7%BF%BB%E7%BF%A0%E8%A2%96%C2%B7%E5%AF%BB%E9%A3%8E%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F3907%2Fdetail%3Fbbs_presentation_style%3Dno_header%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22obc-content%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E7%BF%BB%E7%BF%A0%E8%A2%96%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1753373797852\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">任君自游</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">同调(I&nbsp;/II&nbsp;/III)阶</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">敌人受到来自场上角色造成的全伤害提高<strong>（<span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">2.0%/4.0%/6.0%</span>）</strong>（该效果为独立加成）（唯一生效）。一客道游装备时，敌人受到来自自身的物理伤害提高<strong>（<span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">2.0%/4.0%/6.0%</span>）</strong>（该效果为独立加成）</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">食在江湖</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:0秒]</span></strong>武器主动技效果由装备角色的类型决定。若装备佩戴者具有<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>天渊易位</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;天渊易位&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;技能：角色的能力特性之一，拥有此特性的角色可在星之环启动时释放一个强力的入场技能&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>特性，则造成的物理伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">25.0%</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">一客逍游使用时：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">●<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>斗转星移</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;技能：拥有&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;天渊易位&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;的角色在星之环启动时释放的强力入场技能统称&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>期间，点按QTE键为后续攻击充能，额外造成共计<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">500.0%</span></strong>攻击力的物理伤害（视为<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>斗转星移</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;技能：拥有&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;天渊易位&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;的角色在星之环启动时释放的强力入场技能统称&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>与QTE伤害）</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">●普通攻击与武器技命中敌人时，为目标附加以下效果：每0.25秒对其造成<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">1点流血积蓄值</span></strong>，持续1秒，重复触发刷新持续时间</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">缘味忆乡</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">流血伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">23.0%</span></strong>。一客逍游装备时：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">●攻击使敌人当前生命值为0时，刷新武器技的冷却时间，该效果具有1秒的冷却时间</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">●星之环激活时，自身造成的物理伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">20.0%</span></strong>，全队角色造成的全伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">25.0%</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">知味山河</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">敌人受到来自自身的物理伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">11.0%</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">一客逍游装备时，全队角色造成的物理伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">16.0%</span></strong>，造成的全元素伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">18.0%</span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/3907/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/03/07/50494840/931722a7edf0eebb4c94a3bc6c0558bc_8012355489933074247.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">获得「 翻翠袖」后解锁锻造</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*4</span></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"o